.DS_Store
node_modules
/build
/.svelte-kit
/package
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

# Extension working area: a sparse checkout of raycast/extensions and the
# bundles built from it. Both are reproducible from scripts, and the checkout
# alone is hundreds of megabytes.
/extensions/raycast-src/
/extensions/build/

# Bundled extension host output.
/host/dist/
/host/node_modules/

# `tauri icon` regenerates every platform's icon set from `master.png`, Android
# and iOS trees and a macOS `.icns` included. Sill is a Win32 application and
# runs on none of them, so those are not kept, and `bundle.icon` in
# `tauri.conf.json` no longer names the `.icns`. Ignored rather than only
# deleted, because the next person to regenerate icons would commit them back.
/src-tauri/icons/android/
/src-tauri/icons/ios/
/src-tauri/icons/icon.icns
